---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import StpLab from '../../components/StpLab';
---
<Base title="Spanning Tree Lab" description="Interactive spanning tree simulator: change bridge priorities and link speeds, cut links, and watch root election, port roles and blocking.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Spanning tree lab</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted">
      Four switches are cabled in a ring with a diagonal shortcut, which would be a broadcast storm without spanning
      tree. Change bridge priorities and link speeds, cut links, and see which bridge becomes root, which ports
      forward, and which are blocked, with the reason for each. Complete the missions to learn the rules.
    </p>
    <StpLab client:load />
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">
      Read the theory in <a class="text-accent underline" href="/learn/layer2/02-loops-and-spanning-tree">Loops and the Spanning Tree Protocol</a>{' '}
      and <a class="text-accent underline" href="/learn/layer2/03-rstp-and-mstp">RSTP and MSTP</a>, then build it in the{' '}
      <a class="text-accent underline" href="/labs/rstp-triangle">RSTP triangle lab</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
